Simplify: !\old(this.isEmpty()) => (\old(this.getFirst()) == null ? \result == null : \result.equals(\old(this.getFirst()))). But we can't use conditional.

We'll use disjunction: (!\old(this.isEmpty())) => ( (\result == null && \old(this.getFirst()) == null) || (\result != null && \result.equals(\old(this.getFirst())) ) );

